    "红卡会撤下，Pip 和面板不再显示出口；后台照常检查，重新打开立即恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The red card goes away and Pip and the panel stop showing the egress. Checks keep running in the background; turn it back on to restore everything right away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "终端": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "给 Claude Code 装上 Notchkeeper 自带的 mod：只记录每个回合怎么结束，不记录对话内容。安装会在 ~/.claude/settings.json 里加一项插件，卸载时去掉。已经开着的会话要重开或运行 /reload-plugins 才生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installs the mod that ships with Notchkeeper into Claude Code. It only records how each turn ended, never the conversation. Installing adds a plugin entry to ~/.claude/settings.json; uninstalling removes it. Sessions already open need a restart or /reload-plugins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
